"""Content of the "Vehicle authorisation" tab: the process flowchart and the map of certificates and
declarations, with the links between them. Built into the map by navigator.build_va().

Sources (all in the library): Regulation (EU) 2018/545 (PA VA), Directive (EU) 2016/797 (Art. 9, 10, 15, 21,
24, 25, Annex IV), Regulation (EU) 2019/250 (templates), Regulation (EU) 402/2013 (CSM RA), ERA's PA VA
Guidelines v2.1 (ERA1209/222) and clarification note ERA1209/039.

Each node:  id, t (title), kind, position, d (detail paragraphs), refs (resolved like task-path refs:
family key, short name, cited label or file-name fragment), and for process nodes `certs` (ids in the
certificate map it produces or uses); certificate nodes list `steps` (process ids where they appear).
Edges: (from, to, label[, style]) where style "dash" marks an optional or indirect link, "no"/"yes" label
decision exits.
"""

